<title>USA: US Mint buys 263,000 kg nickel for $6.8897/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 263,000 kg nickel for $6.8897/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Wednesday that it bought 263,000 kg of surplus nickel at $6.8897 per kg from Phoenixx International Resources of Pittsburgh, Pa.</p>
<p>The total sale price of the nickel was $1,811,991.10, the Mint said.</p>
